<title>SRI LANKA: Hayleys Photoprint up on bonus, rights news.</title>
<headline>Hayleys Photoprint up on bonus, rights news.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Hayleys Photoprint Ltd rose 38.10 percent or eight rupees to 29.00, on retail buying in early Wednesday trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Small investors are buying after Tuesday's bonus and rights announcement,&quot; said a local broker. &quot;The share is also cheap enough for them.&quot;</p>
<p>On Tuesday, the company announced a rights issue of one new share for every two held at 10 rupees, in addition to a bonus issue of one new share for every three held.</p>
<p>Hayleys Photoprint is a subsidiary of blue chip Hayleys Ltd. -- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
